'''Pizza Mania （Clicker）''' is a cross-platform idle [[:Category:Game worlds|game world]] created by {{VRC link|https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_2ece0ae4-36f8-456c-b723-a780f3cbf222|Kireya}}. Players click a pizza, buy buildings that generate pizzas, and catch golden pizzas.

== Layout ==

The world is a kitchen with an oven and a kitchen teleport, plus a candy shop, a boat, and a Vespa. A Polaroid camera, mirrors, and a video player are in the room. Quest has a dark-mode setting.

A keypad on the pizzeria door opens a VIP room with arcade cabinets (Space Invaders, Tetris, Pong, and Snake), a pool table, spin the bottle, the slot machine, and a pineapple. The door code changes every 90 seconds. Patreon supporters of the creator see the code and can walk in without it.

== Gameplay ==

Clicks on the pizza. Buildings add pizzas per second (PPS). The shop sells copies in batches of 1, 10, 100, or Max. Each extra copy of a building costs 15% more than the last. Ascension opens at 1 trillion pizzas this run and pays parmesan crumbs from that total.

=== Golden pizzas ===

Golden pizzas appear every 5–15 minutes and last 13 seconds. Catching one applies FRENZY (7× PPS for 77 seconds), CLICK FRENZY (777× click value for 13 seconds), LUCKY (an instant pile of pizzas), or PIZZA STORM (seven extra golden pizzas that each apply LUCKY).

LUCKY adds pizzas at once. It pays 13% of the current pile, or 15 minutes of PPS, whichever is larger, then Lucky upgrades on top. With those upgrades, one LUCKY more than doubles a large unspent pile. Catching all seven pizzas in a storm can raise the total by hundreds of times.

=== Playthrough ===

<div class="spoiler"><div tabindex="0" class="spoiler-overlay"><span>Spoiler</span></div><div class="spoiler-content" inert="">
The next copy or ×2 upgrade that adds the most PPS per pizza spent comes first. Nonna is a stronger first purchase than Hands. Each building has twelve ×2 upgrades. They appear at 1, 5, 25, 50, 100, 150, 200, 250, 300, 350, 400, and 450 copies of that building.

The times assume a first run, buys in the same steps, and catches most golden pizzas. After Lucky upgrades, a large unspent pile lets each LUCKY multiply the total. Median time to the first Pizza Itself is about 18 hours (In lucky runs it's less than 12 hours, in unlucky runs it's less than 36 hours). Ascension opens around 1 hour.

