=== Slots ===

A three-reel machine in the VIP room opens after an ascension. A spin costs 100 pizzas. Matching symbols pay the spin cost times the symbol's multiplier. A 100× or higher win is a jackpot.

=== Parties and leaderboards ===

Parties join with a code. Clicks add to a shared total. Members who are not the owner can request purchases for the owner. A leaderboard ranks pizzas, PPS, click value, crumbs, lifetime totals, and buildings.

=== Persistence ===

Progress saves with [[Special:MyLanguage/Persistence|Persistence]]. Offline pizzas apply on return, up to a time cap and at a fraction of online PPS.

